{
 "title": "Designing Slides: Shapes, Pictures, Styles — LayerCue from Zero, Episode 10",
 "version": 1,
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "chapter": "Putting things on",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Welcome back! Today, we design a lower third: the name band under a speaker.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The Insert group adds things: text, shapes, icons, pictures, and video.",
     "pause": 1.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "From the ribbon, they land in the middle of the slide, already selected.",
     "pause": 1.8,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Right-click the canvas instead, and they land where you clicked.",
     "pause": 2.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "chapter": "Shapes and icons",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Insert shape offers fourteen shapes. Here's a star.",
     "pause": 2.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "It lands in the middle, ready to move or resize.",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Insert icon searches about fifteen hundred icons.",
     "pause": 3.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "An icon takes its color from the Text color.",
     "pause": 2.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "chapter": "A fading band",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Now the band. Draw a wide rectangle near the bottom.",
     "pause": 3.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Open Fill, and choose Linear.",
     "pause": 2.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Set the right end to No fill, and the band fades to transparent.",
     "pause": 3.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Radius rounds the corners.",
     "pause": 2.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "chapter": "Exact placement",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Place sets the position and size as a percent of the slide.",
     "pause": 7.5,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Type the numbers, and the band sits in exactly the same spot on every slide.",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Then place the name on the band the same way, and bring it to the front.",
     "pause": 15.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "chapter": "One style, many slides",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Right-click the name, and choose Copy style.",
     "pause": 2.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Then right-click another box, and choose Paste style.",
     "pause": 3.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The look comes along. The words and the position stay.",
     "pause": 1.2,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "In Show mode, select twenty cards, and paste a style onto all of them at once.",
     "pause": 6.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "chapter": "What's next",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "You can now design a lower third, and restyle many slides at once.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Next time: music, on its own channel.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}